cosmic-sound-theme: cosmic-sound-theme (System76 COSMIC Sound Theme)
cosmic-sound-theme:
cosmic-sound-theme: The source file is the .mmpz file; it's a standard LMMS project, and
cosmic-sound-theme: uses only default instruments and effects. It was created in LMMS 1.2,
cosmic-sound-theme: but it may work in LMMS 1.1.3 as well. Each different sound is its own
cosmic-sound-theme: track, and there's a segment for each sound. Some tracks may require
cosmic-sound-theme: trimming to ensure they don't have too much silence. Be sure to apply
cosmic-sound-theme: a compressor and to normalize the sounds to ensure that chords aren't
cosmic-sound-theme: excessively loud and single-notes aren't too quiet. The ideal peak
cosmic-sound-theme: seems to be close to 0.6-ish in Audacity.
cosmic-sound-theme: Homepage: https://github.com/pop-os/cosmic-sound-theme
